# Samsung Gallery Clone Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Create a fast, GPU-accelerated image gallery application ("Samsung Gallery Clone") using C++ and Qt 6.9.3. The application will be portable (self-contained folder) and run on Windows 7-11 (x64). It will use Qt Quick (QML) for the UI to ensure fluid animations and GPU rendering.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Single EXE vs Portable Folder**: The requirement for a "single .exe" is difficult to achieve with standard dynamic Qt builds without third-party tools (like Enigma Virtual Box) or a static Qt build (which is not available in the standard installation). I will provide a **portable folder** containing the EXE and all necessary DLLs, which is the standard Qt deployment method.

> [!NOTE]
> **Windows 7 Support**: Qt 6 officially supports Windows 10 (1809) and later. While it *might* run on Windows 7, it is not guaranteed. I will target x64 as it is the standard for modern GPU-accelerated apps.

## Proposed Changes

### Project Structure
- `CMakeLists.txt`: Build configuration.
- `src/main.cpp`: Entry point, QML engine setup.
- `src/ImageModel.h/cpp`: C++ model to scan directories and provide image data to QML.
- `resources/qml/Main.qml`: Main application window.
- `resources/qml/GalleryView.qml`: Grid view of images.
- `resources/qml/PhotoViewer.qml`: Full-screen image viewer.

### Build System
- **Generator**: Ninja
- **Compiler**: MinGW 13.1.0 (g++)
- **Qt Version**: 6.9.3 (mingw_64 kit)

### Components

#### [MODIFY] [CMakeLists.txt](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/CMakeLists.txt)
- Configure project "SamsungGallery".
- Find Qt6 packages (Quick, Core, Gui).
- Add executable and link libraries.
- Copy QML files to build directory or use Qt Resource System.

#### [NEW] [src/main.cpp](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/main.cpp)
- Initialize `QGuiApplication`.
- Register `ImageModel` type.
- Load `Main.qml`.

#### [NEW] [src/ImageModel.cpp](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/ImageModel.cpp)
- Inherit from `QAbstractListModel`.
- Use `QDirIterator` to scan for images (jpg, png, etc.).
- Expose roles: `FilePath`, `FileName`.

#### [NEW] [resources/qml/Main.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/resources/qml/Main.qml)
- `ApplicationWindow` with dark theme.
- StackView for navigation (Gallery -> Photo).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- None planned for this prototype phase.

### Manual Verification
1.  **Build**: Run `build.ps1` and ensure it compiles without errors.
2.  **Run**: Execute the generated `.exe`.
3.  **Gallery View**: Verify images are loaded from a test directory (e.g., `Pictures`).
4.  **Scrolling**: Verify smooth scrolling (GPU acceleration).
5.  **View Photo**: Click an image to open full screen.
6.  **Deployment**: Run `deploy.ps1` and verify the output folder runs on another location (simulated by moving the folder).
